 "summary": "A single NPN bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, rated 40 V collector to emitter, 75 V collector to base and 0.6 A of collector current, with 300 mW of dissipation. DC current gain is 100 to 300 at 150 mA and is sorted into two ranks, L (100 to 200) and H (200 to 300). Switching times are specified at 150 mA and transition frequency is at least 300 MHz. Its PNP counterpart is the MMBT2907A.",
