   "topic": "Gain ranks and marking",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "The gain at 150 mA and 10 V splits into rank L, 100 to 200, and rank H, 200 to 300. The top of the body carries the code 1P."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Complement",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The PNP type that pairs with it is the MMBT2907A."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Package and assembly",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Rated moisture sensitivity level 1 under J-STD-020, with 260 °C as the highest lead-free reflow peak. The mold compound is UL 94V-0, RoHS compliant and free of halogens. The leads are solder plated and pass the MIL-STD-750 method 2026 solderability test. One part weighs 0.008 g; a 7-inch reel holds 3000."
  }
